Mika Buzzle is a gnome who works for the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]]. He wears a heavy patchwork cloak in bright colors over clothes hung with jewellery and little crystals, with a great many pockets sewn on, and he reads cards for people he meets.

He hears spirits, which he calls his cousins. They are loud enough that he covers his ears, and when he calls on them they crowd in, call him names and urge him to things. He can push them onto someone else to harry them, and in a fight he goes still and twitchy.
